{
  "score_support": "supports_wrong_score",
  "score_support_basis": "CoT推理将两个明确的行动（解释\\independent、加粗表格中方法）都判定为'vague on how to execute'，从而给3分。但这两项行动都是具体的、可直接执行的修改要求（添加术语解释、将特定方法加粗），符合5分的标准。真实标签为5。",
  "error_sentences": [
    {
      "sentence": "However, it is vague because it does not specify what level of detail is expected or how to provide the explanation.",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "要求解释\\independent的含义就是一个明确的行动，评分标准明确指出'Clarification questions should be treated as explicit statements if they give a direct action'，作者知道需要做什么（添加解释），不应判定为vague。"
    },
    {
      "sentence": "This is an explicit instruction to bold the methods with the same-level efficiency, but it is also vague because it does not specify which methods exactly (e.g., which rows or columns in Table 1) or how to implement the bolding (e.g., in the text or in the table).",
      "error_type": "rubric_misapplication",
      "explanation": "评论中'根据Table 1，除LNCM外所有方法效率相同，因此都应加粗'已经明确指出了具体操作对象（除LNCM外的所有方法）和操作（加粗），这是一个有具体细节的明确行动，符合5分标准，而不是3分。"
    }
  ],
  "overall_basis": "CoT推理因错误地认为两个行动都缺乏具体执行细节而给出3分，但实际上两项行动都是具体的、可直接实施的修改要求，应为5分。关键错误在于对评分标准中'concrete actions'的误判。"
}
